{"2482110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rogue Mech", "steam_appid": 2482110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Mech is a top-down survival game where you'll do a lot more than crush other mechs - You trade, hack, dig, plant, loot, upgrade, free prisoners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.poster.avif?t=1787301509\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.webm?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.mp4?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/90021d042f22cbb094ed58444eeeb3a9.webp?t=1787301509\" width=300 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Mech takes place in a wasteland where earthquakes and volcanic eruptions are a daily occurrence. You control Tasha, a renegade with a heart of gold (or rather silver). She is trapped in this area surrounded by deadly artifacts, together with ruthless militias and a bunch of mad punks with bad teeth and rocket launchers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/97a3a22fd1a749cedd2499af1fe252d7.poster.avif?t=1787301509\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/97a3a22fd1a749cedd2499af1fe252d7.webm?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/97a3a22fd1a749cedd2499af1fe252d7.mp4?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/419856c486fd2042ba077bcbb5dd3df7.webp?t=1787301509\" width=300 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting isn't everything—if you want to survive, you'll have to somehow grow something in this dead world. But you can't do it alone. So set up a cozy base, find allies and watch them harvest your crops. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.poster.avif?t=1787301509\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.webm?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.mp4?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a nice side effect, they will help you maintain your mech and produce ammunition. If you find some raw materials. And machinery. And fuel to operate them. There is a lot to do.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/6282aa55716275b86517b7f42ac44a2e.webp?t=1787301509\" width=300 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting new items for your mech is a big part of the game - hack bunkers, dig in the ash or just shoot it off enemy mechs! Upgrade and repair your weapons, install a magnetic shield, a jumpjet, or a boost to crush enemy vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.poster.avif?t=1787301509\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.webm?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.mp4?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/9885831b02e2d5d489310e5eb69d62d0.webp?t=1787301509\" width=300 height=50 /></span></p>A frontal attack is not always the best option - Cut energy supplies, sabotage air support or hack a defensive turret. Develop a strategy, break free from the oppression and find your lost family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.poster.avif?t=1787301509\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.webm?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.mp4?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/ccb05d9bed1f2b3baee3ae773fe40787.webp?t=1787301509\" width=300 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, plain old violence is the only option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/1f408c523ccf9b893657ef17825f4b9f.poster.avif?t=1787301509\" width=600 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/1f408c523ccf9b893657ef17825f4b9f.webm?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/1f408c523ccf9b893657ef17825f4b9f.mp4?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Mech is a top-down survival game where you'll do a lot more than crush other mechs - You trade, hack, dig, plant, loot, upgrade, free prisoners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.poster.avif?t=1787301509\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.webm?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.mp4?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: