kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.webm?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.mp4?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a nice side effect, they will help you maintain your mech and produce ammunition. If you find some raw materials. And machinery. And fuel to operate them. There is a lot to do.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/6282aa55716275b86517b7f42ac44a2e.webp?t=1787301509\" width=300 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting new items for your mech is a big part of the game - hack bunkers, dig in the ash or just shoot it off enemy mechs! Upgrade and repair your weapons, install a magnetic shield, a jumpjet, or a boost to crush enemy vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.poster.avif?t=1787301509\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.webm?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.mp4?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/9885831b02e2d5d489310e5eb69d62d0.webp?t=1787301509\" width=300 height=50 /></span></p>A frontal attack is not always the best option - Cut energy supplies, sabotage air support or hack a defensive turret. Develop a strategy, break free from the oppression and find your lost family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.poster.avif?t=1787301509\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.webm?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.mp4?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/ccb05d9bed1f2b3baee3ae773fe40787.webp?t=1787301509\" width=300 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, plain old violence is the only option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/1f408c523ccf9b893657ef17825f4b9f.poster.avif?t=1787301509\" width=600 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/1f408c523ccf9b893657ef17825f4b9f.webm?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/1f408c523ccf9b893657ef17825f4b9f.mp4?t=1787301509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p>", "short_description": "Take control of a mech pilot gone rogue in a world of ash and ruthless factions. Explore the wasteland, upgrade your arsenal and forge alliances. Create a safe haven, grow crops and scavenge for resources in this hearty, post-apocalyptic adventure.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Japanese", "reviews": "“Such a good mix of things thematically”<br>Indie Game Clinic<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/f3438114a4b2a8941d4103cbcc266bc686f92cb1/header.jpg?t=1787301509", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/b5b3381a98ac965bfca625fff98b033bae49902c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787301509", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/b5b3381a98ac965bfca625fff98b033bae49902c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787301509", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Haswell 2 cores / 4 threads @ 2.5Ghz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 550 Ti or equivalent, 2GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Haswell 4 cores / 4 threads @ 3.2Ghz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 550 Ti or equivalent, 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Sinking Dutchman"], "publishers": ["Sinking Dutchman"], "demos": [{"appid": 2772500, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true